  "body": "Main is red in the post-merge gate. This PR makes the three red tests green.\n\n## Test 1: Post dialog (guilty merge: PR #3307, 887d8da2a)\n\n`egui_app::post_dialog_tests::desktop_post_command_opens_dialog_and_applies_declared_script_options_undoably`\n\n```\npanicked at crates\\ui\\src\\egui_app\\post_dialog_tests.rs:69:5:\nassertion `left == right` failed: clicking Write tool list at [[551.0 514.0] - [569.0 532.0]] must toggle draft value\n  left: Some(Bool(false))\n right: Some(Bool(true))\n```\n\nCause (product defect):\n- PR #3307 adds the Fanuc row \"Manual Guide i blank (G1902 / G1900)\".\n- With this row, the options are higher than the scroll area at a 900 px window. egui shows its floating vertical scroll bar.\n- The bar lies over the right edge of the content, where `check_row` puts the checkbox. The click goes to the bar, not to the checkbox. A user has the same problem.\n- Proof: at a 1400 px window (no scroll bar) the test passes, with the same checkbox rect.\n\nChange: `crates/ui/src/egui_app/post_dialog.rs` keeps a right gutter in the scroll content, as wide as the scroll bar (`bar_width + bar_inner_margin + bar_outer_margin`). The test keeps its 900 px window. It now also pins the new `manualGuideBlank` row: listed, off by default, toggles, is applied in the same undo step, and Ctrl+Z removes it.\n\n## Tests 2 and 3: Adaptive fallback warning (guilty merge: PR #3108, 92935735e)\n\n```\nblind_slot_pocket_family_cuts_from_end_wall_to_stock_edge\npanicked at crates\\app\\tests\\blind_slot.rs:142:13:\nassertion `left == right` failed: Adaptive2D\n  left: 1\n right: 0\n```\n\n```\nadaptive2d_spiral_and_offset2d_support_relief_while_trochoidal_and_do_not_touch_refuse\npanicked at crates\\app\\tests\\corner_relief_safety.rs:177:5:\nadaptive2d dogbone verify must be silent: [StrategyFallback { at: 2, areas: 1 }]\n```\n\nCause (test only): PR #3108 makes an Adaptive fallback to the Offset rings an advisory `StrategyFallback` warning. These two tests still expected zero warnings. The only warning is `StrategyFallback`, and its `areas` agrees with `machining2d::rings_fallbacks(&notes)`. The product is correct.\n\nChange: the two assertions use the pattern of #3108 (`shoulder_adaptive.rs`): the warning count is 1 only when the notes show a fallback; each warning must be `StrategyFallback` with the same area count and must not block the post. All other checks stay.\n\n## Results (debug, worktree on origin/main 62353ac75)\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib -- --exact egui_app::post_dialog_tests::desktop_post_command_opens_dialog_and_applies_declared_script_options_undoably`: ok.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib`: `test result: ok. 1427 passed; 0 failed; 7 ignored`.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test blind_slot --test corner_relief_safety`: `4 passed` and `3 passed`, 0 failed.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --test blind_slot --test corner_relief_safety -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- Heavy lanes: `cargo xtask gate heavy --base origin/main --dry-run` reaches `app heavy: blind_slot` and `app heavy: corner_relief_safety`. The two files have no `#[ignore]` test, so the lanes are empty. Not run.\n\n## Not exercised\n- The Setup -> Post page (`post_script_options::section`) also draws `check_row` rows. I did not examine it for the same scroll bar overlap.\n- No snapshot PNG changes. The look of the Post dialog changes by the gutter width at the right edge.\n\n## Screenshots\nThe pictures are headless renders of the test harness (`egui_kittest`) at a 900 px window. They show the Post dialog with the built-in Fanuc post. No application window was started.\nThe images are on the images-only `screenshots` branch (commit `308d2de02`). No image is on this PR branch.\n\nBefore: main `62353ac75`. The scroll bar lies over the checkboxes and the fields at the right edge of the rows.\n\n![Before: scroll bar over the right edge of the rows](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/308d2de02c5a62995db77f43ec49d75529abb2d6/pr-3388/post-dialog-before.png)\n\nAfter: this PR head `1fc20d3d0`. The rows keep a gap on the right. The checkboxes are clear of the scroll bar.\n\n![After: checkboxes clear of the scroll bar](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/308d2de02c5a62995db77f43ec49d75529abb2d6/pr-3388/post-dialog-after.png)\n\nChangelog: Post dialog: a checkbox at the right edge of the options is clickable again when the scroll bar shows.\n\nEffort: medium (issue label effort:low; not escalated)\n\nFixes #3384\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n",
